{"meta":{},"result":{"jobOpening":{"jobOpeningShareUrl":"https:\/\/alviere.bamboohr.com\/careers\/36","jobOpeningName":"Backend Software Engineer","jobOpeningStatus":"Open","jobCategoryId":null,"departmentId":"19064","departmentLabel":"Engineering","employmentStatusLabel":"Full-Time","employmentType":null,"location":{"city":"Lisbon","state":null,"postalCode":"1990-095","addressCountry":"Portugal"},"atsLocation":{"country":null,"countryId":null,"state":null,"city":null},"description":"<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold\">Company Summary:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Alviere empowers any business to provide financial services to its customers through the Alviere HIVE technology platform. Alviere streamlines and automates the delivery of financial products like accounts, mobile payments, card issuance, payment processing and cross-border currency exchange, enabling its clients to strengthen customer relationships, increase revenue and maximize profits.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><br><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">The Alviere mission is to ensure everyone has meaningful access to financial tools and solutions, and can find those via the brands and organizations they know and trust. With more access comes more possibility \u2014 enhancing the global financial ecosystem.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><br><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold\">Job Summary:\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Alviere empowers every business to provide financial services to its customers quickly and easily. By providing an advanced single-integration plug and play software service, Alviere streamlines and automates the delivery of financial products like banking, mobile payments, card issuance, payment processing and cross-border currency exchange, enabling its clients to strengthen customer relationships, increase revenue and maximize profits. Exciting opportunity at a rapidly growing Fintech company. Alviere\u2019s state of the art Embedded Finance Platform is transforming how banks and businesses serve their clients.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><br><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">We are looking for a Software Engineer that will join us in a green field project, being responsible for the development and maintenance of our platform. Your primary focus will be development of REST APIs for our back-end services. You will be working within an exceptional engineering team working on different layers of the infrastructure. A commitment to collaborative problem solving, and the creation of quality software is essential. It\u2019s a great opportunity to help build a brand and product.\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><br><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold\">Responsibilities:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Design and implement software and corresponding services<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Collaborate with a team to define, design, and ship new features<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Identify and correct bottlenecks and fix bugs<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Help maintain code quality and organization<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold\">Skills:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Solid experience in designing and implementing REST API providers and consumers<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Good understanding of Clean Architecture<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Demonstrable understanding of secure software principles<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Test-driven development, or experience with testing methodologies<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Detailed understanding of how databases in general, and MySQL in specific, work<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Proficient understanding of Git and Docker containers<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Familiarity with continuous integration<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">A BS\/MS degree in Computer Science, Engineering or a related subject would be great but not required<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Previous work in the Finance sector would be a plus, but not mandatory<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Understanding of multiprogramming (routines) would be a plus<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">It\u2019d be great if you also brought the following experience:<\/span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Interaction with payment providers (credit card and others)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Previous work in the financial sector<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Basic Linux system administration skills<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Docker \/ Kubernetes \/ Gitlab<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Oracle Cloud Infrastructure<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Event driven - Kafka<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold\">Tech Stack:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Microservices: &gt;20 services running<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Event driven architecture: Kafka<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">MySQL<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Redis<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Go, PHP, Python, Javascript<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Gitlab<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Oracle Cloud Infrastructure (OCI)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Kubernetes<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Attlassian<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Slack \/ Zoom<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">Jetbrains IDE\u2019s<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><br><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px\">We pride ourselves on developing and promoting talent as an Equal Employment Opportunity Employer - Veteran\/Disability. All qualified applicant